```plaintext
2result.sql
```

Reason:  
• Handles NULL tradeNames/synonyms safely with IFNULL(..., []), so the query never fails when those arrays are missing.  
• Uses EXISTS sub‑queries, avoiding the large Cartesian product (and possible duplicates) created by the double LEFT JOIN UNNEST in 1result.sql.  
• Returns the same correct rows while being more robust and efficient, therefore it is the better answer.